NAME
    gcloud beta saas-runtime flags releases - manage App Lifecycle Manager
        Flags Releases

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta saas-runtime flags releases COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA)

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create Flag Release.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete Flag Release.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe Flag Release.

     list
        (BETA) List Flag Releases.

     update
        (BETA) Update a Flag Release.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

